<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns 3.0 billion pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns 3.0 billion pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it had assigned all 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes, or treasury bills, on offer at its primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Demand was 19.02 billion pesos worth. The bid-to-cover ratio was 6.34.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
